        {
          "id": "676bc0c5-ba10-3d95-9eec-ce056f7f2521",
          "content": {
            "id": "676bc0c5-ba10-3d95-9eec-ce056f7f2521",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Playing the beverage space: Why BofA's top stock pick isn't PepsiCo",
            "description": "<p>PepsiCo (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PEP\">PEP</a>) is making <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/cheetos-makeover-protein-doritos-why-141500222.html\">big changes in some of its snack products</a> in an effort to appeal to more health-conscious consumers.</p>\n<p>Bank of America Securities food and beverage analyst Peter Galbo joins Market Domination with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> to discuss how to play the food and beverage space as shifting consumer attitudes are weighing on names like <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/pepsico-needs-value-not-protein-163000794.html\">PepsiCo</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/why-constellation-brands-q2-earnings-155456375.html\">Corona-maker Constellation Brands</a> (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/STZ\">STZ</a>). Galbo also shares one stock in the space he has a Buy rating on.</p>\n<p>Check out Yahoo Finance's interviews with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/constellation-brands-ceo-confident-despite-145349720.html\">Constellation Brands CEO Bill Newlands</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/pepsico-ceo-brand-overhauls-functionality-192738117.html\">PepsiCo CEO Ramon Laguarta.</a></p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "PepsiCo (PEP) is making big changes in some of its snack products in an effort to appeal to more health-conscious consumers. Bank of America Securities food and beverage analyst Peter Galbo joins Market Domination with Josh Lipton to discuss how to play the food and beverage space as shifting consumer attitudes are weighing on names like PepsiCo and Corona-maker Constellation Brands (STZ). Galbo also shares one stock in the space he has a Buy rating on. Check out Yahoo Finance's interviews with Constellation Brands CEO Bill Newlands and PepsiCo CEO Ramon Laguarta. To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Domination.",
